generate_seurat_objects_demultiplexed: Generates Seurat objects from raw cell ranger multi output.

MLN_Downstream_Analysis.R: Merges samples into one Seurat object and performs initial quality control and feature plots. 

recluster_no_hashtag.R: This file reclusters the data after hashtag removal.

Cluster_Calling_Clean.R: This file calls the clusters based on canonical markers and specific target markers. 

CD4_TCell_Analysis_clean.R: DEG analysis on CD4 T cell subset

BCell_Analysis_clean.R: DEG analysis on B cell subset

CD4_Th17_Analysis_clean.R: DEG analysis on TH17 subset within CD4 subset. 

VIP_Analysis.R: Uses partial least squares discriminant analysis (a form of supervised PCA) to determine which genes best distinguish each treatment group.
